			"id":"e372b1c056751a1c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Monk Blessing - Outer Room\n\n- Seems normal, but I can't access the elevator\n- On the next day, The Foundation in the mansion disappears and appears in the Outer Room.\n- This causes a problem because you can't draft Outer Rooms anymore.\n- At the start of the Third Day with the Foundation in the Outer Room, there is a new item ([[Repellent]]) in the Entrance Hall with a Letter from Anne Babbage.\n",
